WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:07.839
3 students were asked about the PROBABILITY
of passing in their Mathematics

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:08.839
paper.

00:00:08.839 --> 00:00:09.839
Let’s understand their responses.

00:00:09.839 --> 00:00:18.699
The first student was very sad and said that
the probability of his passing was

00:00:18.699 --> 00:00:19.699
LOW.

00:00:19.699 --> 00:00:24.470
The second one was really happy because he
felt that the probability

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.490
of his passing is VERY HIGH.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.860
The third kid was a little confused.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:31.930
He says that his probability of passing is
somewhere in between.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:39.530
So the probability just tells you HOW LIKELY
it is for an event to occur.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:45.210
Here, the EVENT is passing the EXAM.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:51.280
In the first case, the likelihood passing
is not very likely.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.550
In this case,
the likelihood of passing is very likely.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:57.480
And here, the likelihood of passing is
somewhere in between.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:12.650
But none of them are sure, they are just telling
us what they feel and what is

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:14.630
the most likely outcome!

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:15.850
That’s probability.

